  "translate_en|mods/AirdropMod/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_AirdropMod_AirdropDynamicWeaponWeight": "Dynamic pool weight",
  "translate_en|mods/AirdropMod/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_AirdropMod_AirdropDynamicWeaponWeight_tooltip": "Total weight of the dynamic pool compared to the fixed loot tables (the Military table sums about 24). Each enabled class shares this weight equally, and inside a class every weapon has the same chance, so a mod with many rifles does not drown the rest. Multiplied by the loot level (0.15 / 0.8 / 1.6 / 3.2).",
