  "translate_en|mods/AirdropMod/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_AirdropMod_AirdropDynamicWeapons_tooltip": "Adds every weapon registered in the game, from vanilla or any loaded mod, to the airdrop roll, grouped by category (pistols, rifles, shotguns, axes, blunt, blades, spears). Firearms come with matching ammo when enabled below.",
